    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "ORIGIN",
      "narration_text": "I started on a different project: a Kaggle competition on post-training Google's Gemma model to act as a developer agent. I was in the literature review, reading about reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards, and benchmarks like PostTrainBench and HumanEval.",
