      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "SETUP",
      "narration_text": "So I built a small repository. A Pi-style agent loop, for testing, gives a model one tool: a Python REPL with search helpers like grep and read lines. The model writes code, sees the output, and repeats, for up to twelve turns, until it can answer.",
