      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "BENCHMARK",
      "narration_text": "To test it, I used BABILong, a benchmark published at NeurIPS twenty twenty-four. It hides simple facts inside long books, so answering means finding scattered facts and chaining them together. My first test: one hundred twenty-eight thousand tokens, about two hundred seventy-five pages.",
