      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "FIRST-TEST",
      "narration_text": "For a first test, I gave it one BABILong question: where is the football? The facts that answer it are scattered across the document. The agent traced Daniel taking the ball, dropping it, picking it up, then walking to the kitchen. Its answer, kitchen, matched the benchmark. One question, one run: very early work.",
